[00:00.00] 作词 : Beatrice Laus
[00:01.00] 作曲 : beabadoobee
[00:09.56] Don't stay awake for too long (不要保持清醒太久哦)
[00:13.62] Don't go to bed (也不要上床入眠休息)
[00:16.47] I'll make a cup of coffee for your head (我会为你煮杯咖啡提提神)
[00:20.64] I'll get you up and going out of bed (我会轻声叫醒，扶你起床)
[00:24.82] And I promise that one day (我保证有一天)
[00:28.68] I'll feel fine (我会感觉这不错哦)
